    "        ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢀⣠⣤⣴⣿⣷⣶⣶⣶⣶⣶⣶⣦⣀⣀⣀⣻⡀⠀⠀⠀⣀⣀⠀⡀⠀⠀⠀⢀⣼⣿⠇⠀⠀⠀\n",
